  "id": "27",
  "title": "CBOR 協定",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFB800\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 實現了 <strong>CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation)</strong> — 一種二進位優化的序列化協定，專為任務關鍵型吞吐量和最小化負載開銷而設計。</p></div><h2>二進位優勢</h2><p>CBOR (RFC 8949) 是高效能網路開發中的「後 JSON」標準。它結合了 JSON 的靈活性與二進位編碼的高效率，使其成為 Photon 內部調度與邊緣分片微服務的首選方案。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"2\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"14\" width=\"20\" height=\"8\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"6.01\" y2=\"18\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">30-50% 緊湊化</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">通過消除冗餘的字串鍵名和空格，大幅降低輸出成本和記憶體壓力。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">2.5X 極速解析</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">跳過昂貴的 UTF-8 解析階段。Photon 經過 JIT 優化的 CBOR 編碼器直接在原始記憶體緩衝區上運作。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">RFC_標準化</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">嚴格遵循 IETF 標準，確保與 Python、Go、Rust 及嵌入式 C 叢集的完全互操作性。</p></div></div><h2>整合通訊協定</h2><p>應用二進位優化是一個非破壞性的過程。<code>binaryMiddleware</code> 會根據指令集協定自動處理內容協商 (Content Negotiation)。</p><pre><code>import { Photon, binaryMiddleware } from '@gravito/photon'\n\nconst app = new Photon()\n\n// 全域二進位協定注入\napp.use(binaryMiddleware())\n\napp.get('/api/node-status', (c) => {\n  return c.json({\n    node: 'Edge_Node_01',\n    load: 0.45,\n    redundancy: true\n  })\n})</code></pre><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 協定日誌：內部運作機制</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">中介軟體攔截 <code>application/json</code> 回應。若客戶端發送 <code>Accept: application/cbor</code>，Photon 將繞過標準字串化程序，直接通過核心通訊端串流傳遞二進位區塊。</p></div><h2>效能指標</h2><p>在 M3 Silicon 上收集的基準測試數據突顯了標準 JSON 與 Photon 優化版 CBOR 實現之間的序列化差異。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_CBOR_ENCODE</span> <span>0.24ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,184,0,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 35%; background: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,184,0,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>GENERIC_JSON_STRINGIFY</span> <span>0.68ms</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 95%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 節省：序列化階段延遲降低約 183%</p></div><h2>客戶端調度</h2><p>在客戶端端點使用 <code>cborg</code> 解碼套件，僅需極小的開銷即可解析 CBOR。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">Fetch API</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>const res = await fetch('/api/data', {\n  headers: { Accept: 'application/cbor' }\n})\nconst data = decode(new Uint8Array(await res.arrayBuffer()))</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">React 實作</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>const [data, setData] = useState(null)\nuseEffect(() => {\n  getCborData(url).then(setData)\n}, [url])</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>開發者提示：</strong> 對於超高頻更新（如交易儀表板或 IoT 遙測），結合 <strong>CBOR</strong> 與 <strong>零複製緩衝 (Zero-Copy Buffering)</strong> 可完全消除堆積碎片 (Heap Fragmentation)。</p></div>",
